cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Certified symmetry discovery for polynomial and dictionary vector fields: confidence sets for Lie-algebra generators from noisy vector-field measurements"
abstract: >-
  Symmetry discovery by nullspace computation has no error control and inverts
  the burden of proof. SymCert recasts it as an equivalence test and gives
  confidence bounds on the equivariance defect, computed exactly over a
  confidence region for the model coefficients, that hold simultaneously over
  every candidate generator.
version: "2.0.0"
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kendiukhov/certified-symmetry-discovery"
authors:
